 956:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Return:
 957:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  int16:  Result in mVolts
 958:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *
 959:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Global variables:
 960:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  ADC_DelSig_CountsPerVolt:  used to convert ADC counts to mVolts.
