1007:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** ********************************************************************************
1008:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *
1009:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Summary:
1010:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  Converts the ADC output to Volts as a floating point number. For
1011:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  example, if the ADC measure a voltage of 1.2345 Volts, the
1012:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  returned result would be +1.2345 Volts.
