1070:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Summary:
1071:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  Converts the ADC output to uVolts as a 32-bit integer. For example,
1072:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  if the ADC measured -0.02345 Volts, the return value would be -23450 uVolts.
